                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/6429: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-25T21:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 25,
                                1920—9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 25—2
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>66. The Cabinet met yesterday and agreed to recommend to the Diplomatic Advisory
                    Council the gradual withdrawal of all Japanese troops from Siberia. A meeting of
                    the Council to consider this recommendation will be held shortly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
